    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/b606968eb464d9ffcd3f85704ae227eb.poster.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/b606968eb464d9ffcd3f85704ae227eb.webm?t=1755564140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/b606968eb464d9ffcd3f85704ae227eb.mp4?t=1755564140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/16b5956a45cce1a2785fdbc2e3163e44.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Astro Burn</strong>, you play as <i>Astro</i> \u2014 a fearless feline space pilot returning from a deep-space mission, only to find Earth in ruins, encircled by towering A.I. war machines\u2026 and not a single human in sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/53b26b068b6d8de509b283e66312466f.poster.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/53b26b068b6d8de509b283e66312466f.webm?t=1755564140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/53b26b068b6d8de509b283e66312466f.mp4?t=1755564140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with blazing firepower and purrfect reflexes, blast your way through waves of deadly enemies, uncover the truth behind humanity\u2019s disappearance, and take the fight to the mechanical overlords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/878f2ac410760cd5fda8f6d713adb4e2.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/39344972b35ce6f1390a6e85a78e0f28.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >nostalgic side-scrolling <strong>shoot-\u2019em-up</strong> inspired by 16-bit classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reborn with slick modern pixel art, tight controls, and <strong>adrenaline-pumping action</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite</strong> challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Player Co-Op Arcade mode\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sassy, feline badass packed with cat-tastic quips and purr-fect puns at every turn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock each level as you progress, with the freedom to replay anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn steam achievements\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging end of level bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through 10 diverse levels\u2014from deep space and mechanical worlds to Earth\u2019s skies, underwater realms, sprawling cities, and beyond!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 2\u20133 hours of action-packed gameplay, with even more hours to sink in through skill mastery and level replays</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/b5ec285866a08c575b69e83c59a53964.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Astro Burn</i> is your ticket back to the golden era of 90s side-scrolling shoot-\u2019em-ups \u2014 where the screen is flooded with enemy fire, and only your reflexes stand between glory and a game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/7ead00bcea9fa03069c54880d169ff87.poster.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/7ead00bcea9fa03069c54880d169ff87.webm?t=1755564140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/7ead00bcea9fa03069c54880d169ff87.mp4?t=1755564140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack-Em-Up Weapons System\u00a0</strong>\u00a0- Astro Burn loads you up with an over-the-top arsenal\u2014pulse lasers, grenade blasts, multi-fire scatter shots, and more. Stack your weapons, fire them all at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/64774c088e3e367bf7c36184ba9bd395.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/b12d64b3070c5ce26ec142f1e4188815.poster.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/b12d64b3070c5ce26ec142f1e4188815.webm?t=1755564140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/b12d64b3070c5ce26ec142f1e4188815.mp4?t=1755564140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bosses keep getting bigger, badder, and more claw-worthy with every level. Time to unsheathe those claws, channel your inner badass feline, and go full kitty-chaos on these ruthless machines!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/92862ea29c0b57bfec73894c07839ebf.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/04c43845e8efa5fa594f7d074f3e7053.poster.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/04c43845e8efa5fa594f7d074f3e7053.webm?t=1755564140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/04c43845e8efa5fa594f7d074f3e7053.mp4?t=1755564140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between the chaos and carnage, take a breather and uncover a gripping mystery\u2014why is Earth surrounded by colossal machines, and where have all the humans gone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/f5b31236533d5ccb8cdccd25726b9c40.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/b159675897bda83c64ae58e6319d4397.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/d59e96dc84e7879c4eda13f1a99393ea.poster.avif?t=1755564140\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/d59e96dc84e7879c4eda13f1a99393ea.webm?t=1755564140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/extras/d59e96dc84e7879c4eda13f1a99393ea.mp4?t=1755564140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claw your way to the top of the leaderboard in this purr-fectly retro space shooter \u2014 will you be the ultimate space cat with the high score to match?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
